WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
I said Xue Bing, who is this?

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:04,120
I haven’t seen any new faces before.

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:05,940
All soldiers

4
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:07,540
No common people

5
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:09,660
These people went to the middle of the road to fight

6
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,420
My temper is almost overflowing.

7
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:14,630
It seems like this is daily life in the Thorny Head Camp.

8
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:17,290
He should be the new recruit that the boss was talking about.

9
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,660
Xue Bing won't be soft-hearted, right?

10
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,780
Why is there nothing wrong with this kid?

11
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:31,260
Don't meddle in other people's business

12
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:32,260
This person is different

13
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:33,900
I also want to take him to see the commander-in-chief

14
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:34,980
Never mind who he is

15
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:36,180
Just come to Huangsha Town

16
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:37,180
That's the same

17
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:38,940
You can do whatever you want

18
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:42,620
But you have to wait until I take him to see the commander-in-chief and leave it alone.

19
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:43,660
All raise their hands

20
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:47,570
Xue Bing, you left your post without permission again

21
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,730
I think you want to lock in the coins, right?

22
00:00:50,130 --> 00:00:52,610
Boss, don’t I have something to talk to you about?

23
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:54,210
Tell me what happened quickly

24
00:00:54,210 --> 00:00:55,690
After saying that, get out and go on duty.

25
00:00:55,930 --> 00:00:58,850
Boss, the recruit you mentioned before is here to report.
